OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start in parts of the
OL,6,Fnorth and east. Otherwise all parts
OL,7,Fwill have a dry day with some spells
OL,8,Fof sunshine. Warm. Cooler onshore
OL,9,Fbreeze along the Caithness coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,13,Fwith clear periods and variable
OL,14,Famounts of cloud. Light southerly
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FMainly dry with variable
OL,18,Famounts of cloud and bright spells.
OL,19,FChance of a light shower in the east
OL,20,Flater. Warm along the west coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
