OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry on Wednesday and Thursday although
OL,7,Fsome occasional rain possible at
OL,8,Ftimes. More in the way of persistent
OL,9,Frain likely by Friday, more especially
OL,10,Fin the east.
